<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-13051] Optimized affinity switch on baseline node left is broken for client topology and MVCC</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13051</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If a node contains only client cache topology with MVCC enabled, PME will hang after changes introduced in &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12617&quot; title=&quot;PME-free switch should wait for recovery only at affected nodes.&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-12617&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-12617&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Reproduced by CachePartitionLossWithRestartsTest.testPartitionLossDetectionOnClientTopology&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0 false false -1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; and enabled MVCC.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
