                            <comment id="17125085" author="ascherbakov" created="Wed, 3 Jun 2020 16:13:54 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=avinogradov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;avinogradov&quot;&gt;avinogradov&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=timonin.maksim&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;timonin.maksim&quot;&gt;timonin.maksim&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

