                            <comment id="17126445" author="timonin.maksim" created="Fri, 5 Jun 2020 06:38:35 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ascherbakov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ascherbakov&quot;&gt;ascherbakov&lt;/a&gt;&#160;hi! Could you please check my new PR. I moved validation check to another place that guarantees to cover all possible cases.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17126519" author="ascherbakov" created="Fri, 5 Jun 2020 08:11:28 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=timonin.maksim&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;timonin.maksim&quot;&gt;timonin.maksim&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
